N 52° 18.073 W 113° 45.968&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rats, DNF!!!  Similar to the previous few logs, there wasn't a power pole close to GZ per the hint.  A thorough search didn't reveal the cap.&lt;/p&gt;

