          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP405 Red Deer Event&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This would be the first of two dnfs on the day.  CR's log explains the situation pretty well.  The area has been redeveloped and the cache site is no longer as described.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
