          <groundspeak:finder id="314197">EdgeMonks</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP405 Red Deer Event&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The power pole in the hint/description is gone, and GZ is under pavement. My metal detector did not &quot;beep&quot; near GZ, so it is possible that it was bulldozed when the road was constructed.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
