          <groundspeak:finder id="2319799">CanadianRockies</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP405 - Red Deer Event&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Posted: N52 18.073 W113 45.968&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I strongly suspect this cap is gone. The whole area around Ground Zero has been bulldozed, as it appears a new development will be built here soon. There was no metal guard post nor even a utility pole. Maybe someone with a metal detector can find the cap, but I'd be surprised. See photo.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
